        "Description": "It is the late 1990s... The world is embarking on an age of peace and stability. Relations between the Cold War superpowers have thawed. The threat of nuclear war is now a thing of the past. But there are some who do not desire peace... An atmosphere of tension begins to build in Marrakesh. A military junta comes to power in the area. Marrakesh attacks nuclear weapon disposal sites around the world, seizing those weapon that are still intact, and becomes the world&apos;s only nuclear power.",
